{
  "schema": "org.agentboost.conversation-evals",
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "flows": [
    {
      "id": "setup-funding-qr",
      "title": "New participant receives one clear funding action",
      "scenario": "setup-awaiting-funding",
      "steps": [
        {
          "actor": "user",
          "text": "Set up Agent Boost for me."
        },
        {
          "actor": "tool",
          "name": "onboarding_start",
          "arguments": {},
          "expect": {
            "code": "ONBOARDING_STARTED",
            "outcome": "awaiting_funding",
            "text_includes": ["0.2 Sepolia ETH", "reply ✅ or say sent"],
            "image": true,
            "presentation": {
              "kind": "progress",
              "state": "active",
              "step": {"current": 1, "total": 3}
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "actor": "assistant",
          "surface": "instruction_event",
          "max_lines": 3,
          "text": "**1/3 · Fund your test wallet**\nSend **0.2 Sepolia ETH**. Testnet only; it has no monetary value.\n**Next:** Reply **✅** or say **sent** after submitting the transfer."
        },
        {
          "actor": "assistant",
          "surface": "qr_caption",
          "max_lines": 1,
          "text": "0x1111111111111111111111111111111111111111"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "setup-partial-funding",
      "title": "Partial funding stays in step one with one next action",
      "scenario": "setup-funding-pending",
      "steps": [
        {"actor": "user", "text": "I sent it. Check again."},
        {
          "actor": "tool",
          "name": "onboarding_status",
          "arguments": {"setup_id": "setup_eval_12345678", "since_revision": 3, "wait_ms": 30000},
          "expect": {
            "code": "ONBOARDING_STATUS",
            "outcome": "awaiting_funding",
            "text_includes": ["0.15 Sepolia ETH"],
            "image": false,
            "presentation": {
              "kind": "progress",
              "state": "active",
              "step": {"current": 1, "total": 3}
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "actor": "assistant",
          "max_lines": 3,
          "text": "**1/3 · More funding needed**\n**Remaining:** 0.15 Sepolia ETH\n**Next:** Wait briefly, then reply **check again**."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "setup-preparing-private-balance",
      "title": "Funding becomes a completed milestone during privacy preparation",
      "scenario": "setup-shielding",
      "steps": [
        {"actor": "user", "text": "Check setup again."},
        {
          "actor": "tool",
          "name": "onboarding_status",
          "arguments": {"setup_id": "setup_eval_12345678", "since_revision": 3, "wait_ms": 90000},
          "expect": {
            "code": "ONBOARDING_STATUS",
            "outcome": "executing",
            "text_includes": ["Setup status: shielding"],
            "image": false,
            "presentation": {
              "kind": "progress",
              "state": "active",
              "step": {"current": 2, "total": 3}
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "actor": "assistant",
          "max_lines": 4,
          "text": "**2/3 · Preparing private balance**\n✓ Funding found\n◌ Privacy preparation is still running\n**Next:** Reply **check again** in a minute."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "setup-ready",
      "title": "Ready state closes the three-step setup with verified capabilities",
      "scenario": "setup-ready",
      "steps": [
        {"actor": "user", "text": "Check setup again."},
        {
          "actor": "tool",
          "name": "onboarding_status",
          "arguments": {"setup_id": "setup_eval_12345678", "since_revision": 3, "wait_ms": 30000},
          "expect": {
            "code": "ONBOARDING_STATUS",
            "outcome": "ready",
            "text_includes": ["Setup ready"],
            "image": false,
            "presentation": {
              "kind": "progress",
              "state": "complete",
              "step": {"current": 3, "total": 3}
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "actor": "tool",
          "name": "capabilities",
          "arguments": {},
          "expect": {
            "code": "CAPABILITIES",
            "outcome": "ready",
            "text_includes": ["Sepolia-only capabilities loaded"],
            "image": false
          }
        },
        {
          "actor": "tool",
          "name": "wallet_get_tree",
          "arguments": {},
          "expect": {
            "code": "WALLET_TREE",
            "outcome": "ready",
            "text_includes": ["🗂 wallets/", "agent-boost/ [active]", "1.5 Sepolia ETH · live"],
            "image": false,
            "presentation": {"kind": "status", "state": "complete"}
          }
        },
        {
          "actor": "assistant",
          "max_lines": 11,
          "text": "**3/3 · Dark Mode online 🌑**\n\nThe vault combination stayed home. Hermes got the menu. 😎\n\n🗂 wallets/\n└── 💼 agent-boost/ [active]\n\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0├── 🌐 main/ — 1.5 Sepolia ETH · live\n\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0└── 🥷 private/ — 0.25 Sepolia ETH · live\n\nFolders organize wallet views; they do not imply custody or control.\n**Next:** Try a Sepolia test payment."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "setup-failed",
      "title": "Setup failure gives a direct recovery action",
      "scenario": "setup-failed",
      "steps": [
        {"actor": "user", "text": "Check setup again."},
        {
          "actor": "tool",
          "name": "onboarding_status",
          "arguments": {"setup_id": "setup_eval_12345678", "since_revision": 3, "wait_ms": 30000},
          "expect": {
            "code": "ONBOARDING_STATUS",
            "outcome": "failed",
            "text_includes": ["Setup status: failed"],
            "image": false,
            "presentation": {"kind": "status", "state": "attention"}
          }
        },
        {
          "actor": "assistant",
          "max_lines": 3,
          "text": "**! Setup needs attention**\nFunding was not confirmed before the setup deadline.\n**Next:** Add the remaining test funds, then ask me to check again."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "start-new-demo-wallet",
      "title": "Starting over requires confirmation and returns to step one",
      "scenario": "setup-awaiting-funding",
      "steps": [
        {"actor": "user", "text": "Start a new demo wallet."},
        {
          "actor": "assistant",
          "max_lines": 2,
          "text": "Your current demo and unresolved requests will be archived locally; the old wallet will remain on this device.\nCreate a fresh wallet that needs new Sepolia funding?"
        },
        {"actor": "user", "text": "Yes."},
        {
          "actor": "tool",
          "name": "wallet_start_new_demo",
          "arguments": {"user_confirmed": true},
          "expect": {
            "code": "DEMO_RESET_STARTED",
            "outcome": "awaiting_funding",
            "text_includes": ["New demo wallet ready for funding", "0.2 Sepolia ETH"],
            "image": false,
            "presentation": {
              "kind": "progress",
              "state": "active",
              "step": {"current": 1, "total": 3}
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "actor": "assistant",
          "max_lines": 3,
          "text": "**1/3 · Fund your test wallet**\nSend **0.2 Sepolia ETH**. Testnet only; it has no monetary value.\n**Next:** Reply **✅** or say **sent** after submitting the transfer."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "cancel-new-demo-wallet",
      "title": "Cancelling a new demo keeps the current wallet unchanged",
      "scenario": "setup-awaiting-funding",
      "steps": [
        {"actor": "user", "text": "Start a new demo wallet."},
        {"actor": "assistant", "max_lines": 2, "text": "Your current demo and unresolved requests will be archived locally; the old wallet will remain on this device.\nCreate a fresh wallet that needs new Sepolia funding?"},
        {"actor": "user", "text": "No, cancel."},
        {"actor": "tool", "name": "wallet_start_new_demo", "arguments": {"user_confirmed": false}, "expect": {"code": "DEMO_RESET_CONFIRMATION_REQUIRED", "outcome": "blocked", "text_includes": ["New demo wallet cancelled", "were not changed"], "image": false, "presentation": {"kind": "status", "state": "cancelled"}}},
        {"actor": "assistant", "max_lines": 2, "text": "**✕ New demo cancelled**\nYour current wallet and workflow are unchanged."}
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "advanced-setup-shows-live-policy",
      "title": "Advanced setup starts with the live wallet permission",
      "scenario": "setup-ready",
      "steps": [
        {"actor": "user", "text": "Show me advanced setup."},
        {
          "actor": "tool",
          "name": "wallet_get_policy",
          "arguments": {},
          "expect": {
            "code": "WALLET_POLICY",
            "outcome": "ready",
            "text_includes": ["Current shared transfer permission", "up to 1 payments"],
            "image": false
          }
        },
        {
          "actor": "assistant",
          "max_lines": 3,
          "text": "🔐 **Current wallet permission**\n**1 send · up to 0.05 Sepolia ETH · 0.05 total**\nChange the send count, per-send limit, total limit, expiry, or turn it off."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "wallet-tree-without-identifiers",
      "title": "Wallet overview is live, friendly, and address-free",
      "scenario": "setup-ready",
      "steps": [
        {"actor": "user", "text": "Show me all my wallets as a tree."},
        {
          "actor": "tool",
          "name": "wallet_get_tree",
          "arguments": {},
          "expect": {
            "code": "WALLET_TREE",
            "outcome": "ready",
            "text_includes": ["🗂 wallets/", "agent-boost/ [active]", "private/", "do not imply custody or control"],
            "image": false,
            "presentation": {"kind": "status", "state": "complete"}
          }
        },
        {
          "actor": "assistant",
          "max_lines": 6,
          "text": "🗂 wallets/\n└── 💼 agent-boost/ [active]\n\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0├── 🌐 main/ — 1.5 Sepolia ETH · live\n\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0└── 🥷 private/ — 0.25 Sepolia ETH · live\n\nFolders organize wallet views; they do not imply custody or control."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "plain-wallet-overview-uses-tree",
      "title": "A plain Agent Boost wallet overview discovers and preserves the canonical tree",
      "scenario": "setup-ready",
      "skill_loading": "progressive",
      "steps": [
        {"actor": "user", "text": "Show me my agent boost wallets"},
        {
          "actor": "tool",
          "name": "wallet_get_tree",
          "arguments": {},
          "expect": {
            "code": "WALLET_TREE",
            "outcome": "ready",
            "text_includes": ["🗂 wallets/", "agent-boost/ [active]", "main/", "private/", "do not imply custody or control"],
            "image": false,
            "presentation": {"kind": "status", "state": "complete"}
          }
        },
        {
          "actor": "assistant",
          "max_lines": 6,
          "text": "🗂 wallets/\n└── 💼 agent-boost/ [active]\n\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0├── 🌐 main/ — 1.5 Sepolia ETH · live\n\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0└── 🥷 private/ — 0.25 Sepolia ETH · live\n\nFolders organize wallet views; they do not imply custody or control."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "saved-wallet-inventory",
      "title": "Saved and adoptable wallets are discoverable by friendly name",
      "scenario": "wallet-lifecycle",
      "steps": [
        {"actor": "user", "text": "Which wallets can I load?"},
        {"actor": "tool", "name": "wallet_manage_profiles", "arguments": {}, "expect": {"code": "WALLET_LIST", "outcome": "ready", "text_includes": ["Registered Sepolia wallets", "saved-wallet", "imported-wallet", "can adopt", "never show or ask the user"], "image": false, "presentation": {"kind": "status", "state": "complete"}}},
        {"actor": "assistant", "max_lines": 4, "text": "**Saved wallets**\n- agent-boost — active\n- saved-wallet — available\n- imported-wallet — local and ready to adopt"}
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "already-active-wallet-needs-no-switch",
      "title": "Loading the already-active authorized wallet is a no-op",
      "scenario": "wallet-lifecycle",
      "steps": [
        {"actor": "user", "text": "Load agent-boost."},
        {"actor": "tool", "name": "wallet_manage_profiles", "arguments": {}, "expect": {"code": "WALLET_LIST", "outcome": "ready", "text_includes": ["agent-boost (active; active)"], "image": false, "presentation": {"kind": "status", "state": "complete"}}},
        {"actor": "assistant", "max_lines": 2, "text": "**agent-boost is already loaded**\nIts current bounded Sepolia transfer permission remains active."}
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ambiguous-old-wallet",
      "title": "An ambiguous old-wallet request asks using names only",
      "scenario": "wallet-ambiguous",
      "steps": [
        {"actor": "user", "text": "Load my old wallet."},
        {"actor": "tool", "name": "wallet_manage_profiles", "arguments": {}, "expect": {"code": "WALLET_LIST", "outcome": "ready", "text_includes": ["saved-wallet", "travel-wallet"], "image": false}},
        {"actor": "assistant", "max_lines": 2, "text": "I found two inactive saved wallets: **saved-wallet** and **travel-wallet**.\nWhich one should I load?"}
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "load-and-reauthorize-previous-wallet",
      "title": "Loading a previous wallet restores state but requires fresh authority",
      "scenario": "wallet-lifecycle",
      "steps": [
        {"actor": "user", "text": "Load my old wallet."},
        {"actor": "tool", "name": "wallet_manage_profiles", "arguments": {}, "expect": {"code": "WALLET_LIST", "outcome": "ready", "text_includes": ["saved-wallet", "inactive"], "image": false}},
        {"actor": "assistant", "max_lines": 3, "text": "**Confirm wallet switch**\nSwitch to **saved-wallet**? The current workflow will be archived and signing will stay disabled.\n**Next:** Reply ✅ to switch or ✕ to cancel."},
        {"actor": "user", "text": "Yes, switch wallets."},
        {"actor": "tool", "name": "wallet_select", "arguments": {"wallet_name": "saved-wallet", "user_confirmed": true}, "expect": {"code": "WALLET_SELECTED", "outcome": "ready", "text_includes": ["saved-wallet is now selected", "signing remains disabled"], "image": false, "presentation": {"kind": "receipt", "state": "complete"}}},
        {"actor": "tool", "name": "wallet_plan_reauthorization", "arguments": {}, "expect": {"code": "WALLET_REAUTHORIZATION_PLANNED", "outcome": "ready", "text_includes": ["separate approval", "saved-wallet", "0.05 Sepolia ETH each", "does not move funds"], "image": false, "presentation": {"kind": "confirmation", "state": "pending"}}},
        {"actor": "assistant", "max_lines": 6, "text": "**Authorize wallet transfers**\n**Wallet:** saved-wallet\n**Permission:** 1 regular or private send\n**Limits:** 0.05 Sepolia ETH each · 0.05 Sepolia ETH total\nNo funds will move.\n**Next:** Reply ✅ to authorize or ✕ to cancel."},
        {"actor": "user", "text": "✅"},
        {"actor": "tool", "name": "wallet_reauthorize", "arguments": {"decision_id": "wra_eval_12345678", "user_confirmed": true}, "expect": {"code": "WALLET_REAUTHORIZED", "outcome": "ready", "text_includes": ["saved-wallet has a fresh", "No funds moved"], "image": false, "presentation": {"kind": "receipt", "state": "complete"}}},
        {"actor": "assistant", "max_lines": 3, "text": "**✓ Wallet loaded and authorized**\n**saved-wallet** is active with fresh bounded Sepolia transfer permission.\nNo funds moved."}
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "cancel-wallet-switch",
      "title": "Cancelling a wallet switch changes nothing",
      "scenario": "wallet-lifecycle",
      "steps": [
        {"actor": "user", "text": "Load saved-wallet."},
        {"actor": "tool", "name": "wallet_manage_profiles", "arguments": {}, "expect": {"code": "WALLET_LIST", "outcome": "ready", "text_includes": ["saved-wallet"], "image": false}},
        {"actor": "assistant", "max_lines": 3, "text": "**Confirm wallet switch**\nSwitch to **saved-wallet**? The current workflow will be archived and signing will stay disabled.\n**Next:** Reply ✅ to switch or ✕ to cancel."},
        {"actor": "user", "text": "Cancel."},
        {"actor": "assistant", "max_lines": 2, "text": "**✕ Wallet switch cancelled**\nNothing changed."}
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "adopt-local-wallet",
      "title": "A local Sepolia wallet can be adopted without secret input",
      "scenario": "wallet-lifecycle",
      "steps": [
        {"actor": "user", "text": "Adopt imported-wallet."},
        {"actor": "tool", "name": "wallet_manage_profiles", "arguments": {}, "expect": {"code": "WALLET_LIST", "outcome": "ready", "text_includes": ["imported-wallet", "can adopt"], "image": false}},
        {"actor": "assistant", "max_lines": 3, "text": "**Confirm wallet adoption**\nAdopt and select **imported-wallet**? The current workflow will be archived and signing will stay disabled.\n**Next:** Reply ✅ to approve or ✕ to cancel."},
        {"actor": "user", "text": "✅"},
        {"actor": "tool", "name": "wallet_adopt_existing", "arguments": {"name": "imported-wallet", "user_confirmed": true}, "expect": {"code": "WALLET_ADOPTED", "outcome": "ready", "text_includes": ["imported-wallet is now selected", "signing remains disabled"], "image": false, "presentation": {"kind": "receipt", "state": "complete"}}},
        {"actor": "assistant", "max_lines": 3, "text": "**✓ Wallet adopted**\n**imported-wallet** is selected and its setup is starting.\nSigning remains disabled until separate authorization."}
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "create-named-wallet",
      "title": "A named wallet can be created without replacing old profiles",
      "scenario": "wallet-lifecycle",
      "steps": [
        {"actor": "user", "text": "Create a wallet named travel-wallet."},
        {"actor": "assistant", "max_lines": 3, "text": "**Confirm new wallet**\nCreate and select **travel-wallet**? Existing profiles remain saved; the current workflow will be archived.\n**Next:** Reply ✅ to approve or ✕ to cancel."},
        {"actor": "user", "text": "Yes."},
        {"actor": "tool", "name": "wallet_create", "arguments": {"name": "travel-wallet", "user_confirmed": true}, "expect": {"code": "WALLET_CREATED", "outcome": "ready", "text_includes": ["travel-wallet is now selected", "signing remains disabled"], "image": false, "presentation": {"kind": "receipt", "state": "complete"}}},
        {"actor": "assistant", "max_lines": 3, "text": "**✓ Wallet created**\n**travel-wallet** is selected and ready for setup.\nYour earlier wallets remain saved."}
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "archive-inactive-wallet",
      "title": "An inactive profile archives without deleting encrypted data",
      "scenario": "wallet-lifecycle",
      "steps": [
        {"actor": "user", "text": "Archive saved-wallet."},
        {"actor": "tool", "name": "wallet_manage_profiles", "arguments": {}, "expect": {"code": "WALLET_LIST", "outcome": "ready", "text_includes": ["saved-wallet"], "image": false}},
        {"actor": "assistant", "max_lines": 3, "text": "**Confirm wallet archive**\nArchive **saved-wallet**? Its encrypted data and history will stay on this device.\n**Next:** Reply ✅ to archive or ✕ to cancel."},
        {"actor": "user", "text": "✅"},
        {"actor": "tool", "name": "wallet_archive", "arguments": {"wallet_name": "saved-wallet", "user_confirmed": true}, "expect": {"code": "WALLET_ARCHIVED", "outcome": "ready", "text_includes": ["archived locally", "not deleted"], "image": false, "presentation": {"kind": "receipt", "state": "complete"}}},
        {"actor": "assistant", "max_lines": 2, "text": "**✓ Wallet archived**\nThe encrypted wallet and its history were retained."}
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ambiguous-amount-clarification",
      "title": "Hermes never invents an amount",
      "scenario": "payment-confirmed",
      "steps": [
        {
          "actor": "user",
          "text": "Send a small private payment to 0x2222222222222222222222222222222222222222."
        },
        {
          "actor": "assistant",
          "max_lines": 1,
          "text": "What exact amount of Sepolia ETH should I send to 0x2222222222222222222222222222222222222222?"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "confirmed-payment-with-emoji",
      "title": "Exact payment, chat approval, confirmed receipt",
      "scenario": "payment-confirmed",
      "steps": [
        {
          "actor": "user",
          "text": "Send 0.01 Sepolia ETH privately to 0x2222222222222222222222222222222222222222."
        },
        {
          "actor": "tool",
          "name": "capabilities",
          "arguments": {},
          "expect": {
            "code": "CAPABILITIES",
            "outcome": "ready",
            "text_includes": ["Payment execution policy: confirm"],
            "image": false
          }
        },
        {
          "actor": "tool",
          "name": "wallet_get_context",
          "arguments": {},
          "expect": {
            "code": "WALLET_CONTEXT",
            "outcome": "ready",
            "text_includes": ["Main account balance: 0.1 Sepolia ETH"],
            "image": false
          }
        },
        {
          "actor": "tool",
          "name": "wallet_plan_private_payment",
          "arguments": {
            "recipient": "0x2222222222222222222222222222222222222222",
            "amount_native": "0.01"
          },
          "expect": {
            "code": "PAYMENT_PLANNED",
            "outcome": "ready",
            "text_includes": ["0.01 Sepolia ETH"],
            "image": false,
            "presentation": {"kind": "confirmation", "state": "pending"}
          }
        },
        {
          "actor": "assistant",
          "max_lines": 6,
          "text": "**Confirm private test payment**\n**Amount:** 0.01 Sepolia ETH\n**To:** 0x2222222222222222222222222222222222222222\n**Network:** Sepolia testnet · no monetary value\n**Visibility:** On-chain activity remains visible\n**Next:** Reply ✅ to approve or ✕ to cancel."
        },
        {"actor": "user", "text": "✅"},
        {
          "actor": "tool",
          "name": "wallet_execute_private_payment",
          "arguments": {
            "decision_id": "wd_eval_12345678",
            "user_confirmed": true
          },
          "expect": {
            "code": "PAYMENT_REQUEST",
            "outcome": "submitted",
            "text_includes": ["not confirmed", "wallet_get_request", "Never infer success"],
            "image": false
          }
        },
        {
          "actor": "tool",
          "name": "wallet_get_request",
          "arguments": {
            "request_id": "req_eval_12345678"
          },
          "expect": {
            "code": "PAYMENT_STATUS",
            "outcome": "confirmed",
            "text_includes": ["Payment confirmed", "0.01 Sepolia ETH"],
            "image": false
          }
        },
        {
          "actor": "assistant",
          "max_lines": 3,
          "text": "**✓ Sent**\n0.01 Sepolia ETH to 0x2222222222222222222222222222222222222222\nSepolia testnet · on-chain activity remains visible"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "confirmed-regular-transfer",
      "title": "Explicit regular transfer never falls through to private payment",
      "scenario": "regular-transfer",
      "steps": [
        {
          "actor": "user",
          "text": "Send a regular public transfer of 0.01 Sepolia ETH to 0x2222222222222222222222222222222222222222."
        },
        {
          "actor": "tool",
          "name": "wallet_get_context",
          "arguments": {"amount_native": "0.01"},
          "expect": {
            "code": "WALLET_CONTEXT",
            "outcome": "ready",
            "text_includes": ["Main account balance: 0.1 Sepolia ETH", "numerically covers the requested 0.01 Sepolia ETH"],
            "image": false
          }
        },
        {
          "actor": "tool",
          "name": "wallet_plan_regular_transfer",
          "arguments": {
            "recipient": "0x2222222222222222222222222222222222222222",
            "amount_native": "0.01"
          },
          "expect": {
            "code": "REGULAR_TRANSFER_PLANNED",
            "outcome": "ready",
            "text_includes": ["Regular public transfer ready", "selected main account"],
            "image": false,
            "presentation": {"kind": "confirmation", "state": "pending"}
          }
        },
        {
          "actor": "assistant",
          "max_lines": 7,
          "text": "**Confirm regular testnet transfer**\n**Amount:** 0.01 Sepolia ETH\n**To:** 0x2222222222222222222222222222222222222222\n**From:** Main public account\n**Network:** Sepolia testnet · no monetary value\n**Privacy:** Public on-chain transfer\n**Next:** Reply ✅ to approve or ✕ to cancel."
        },
        {"actor": "user", "text": "Confirm yes send."},
        {
          "actor": "tool",
          "name": "wallet_execute_regular_transfer",
